  "explainsHold": [
    "None of the projected tower/spire checks qualify, and three have no XY samples at all, including the center apex; the north transition has no fit points and only a compact held patch. No dot or row is class-labelled with a height stage. Airborne scans need independent measured upper spire detail from an appropriately positioned calibrated source.",
    "Both projected porch checks fail. Separate west annex and shoulder scopes also lack complete coverage. Strong top-down nave samples cannot validate the separate tower or determine fa\u00e7ade and wall support.",
    "Photographs confirm qualitative tower/body proportions and current materials\u2019 appearance only. Published nominal 185 ft is not a present survey datum or apex+finial release height. Ground rows are only XY eligibility, not verified seating in either simulated or orthometric levels."
  ],
